  description: "You can only use 1 \"Exchange of Night and Day\" effect per turn,
    and only once that turn. You can activate 1 of these effects;\n\u25CF Send 1
    LIGHT Warrior-Type monster from your hand to the Graveyard, then add 1 DARK Warrior-Type
    monster from your Deck to your hand, with the same Level the sent monster had
    in your hand.\n\u25CF Send 1 DARK Warrior-Type monster from your hand to the
    Graveyard, then add 1 LIGHT Warrior-Type monster from your Deck to your hand,
    with the same Level the sent monster had in your hand."
